# Codemap sync

Update `.cursor/CODEMAP.md` in the same change when you:
- add, rename, move, or delete a top-level folder or a folder under `src/`
- rename, move, or delete any file path listed in the codemap
- change a test, lint, typecheck, or migration command it lists

Keep entries to one line with full repo-relative paths. No file counts or line numbers.
`scripts/ci/check-codemap-paths.mjs` (run by `npm run lint:check`) fails if a listed path no longer exists.
